lines=['# Unchanged V9 evaluation: baseline status','','**No official historical V9 baseline has been executed. No historical four-sport scoring spread is established.** M6.3 remains unaccepted. Unknown inputs, historical chronology, source inventory and material methodology choices are not removed to force a result.','','## Actual historical diagnostics','',f"Existing hash-bound partitions contain {status['sourceQualifiedScoringRows']:,} source-qualified score rows. The [44-cohort input diagnostics](../reports/m6-v9-input-diagnostics.json) report counts, known numerical sums and observed score ranges. These are unowned player-game inputs, not drafted franchise starter totals. They cannot establish mean/median franchise performance or cross-sport balance.", '', 'The NHL source overlay resolves all441original contradictory rows using terminal native-event actors;438 additional rows have complete scoring inputs and480,148 now meet retrospective selected/played criteria. Unknown1,979shutout credits remain unknown. Excluding these cases can preferentially remove strong goalie games, so near-total numerical completeness is not an unbiased baseline.', '', 'All strict decision-time cohorts remain blocked by missing historical known-at information. No production ownership, starter history, worker receipt or finalization record is required to generate synthetic fantasy state; those production-only records are not the blocker.', '', '## Engine workloads — synthetic only','','Twelve franchises, nine starters per sport, five sport-specific bench seats, five shared bench seats and five IR capacity were exercised. Explicit fixture allocation is NFL2/MLB1/NBA1/NHL1; it is not an approved historical strategy. All professional identities, health, schedule and outcomes in this workload are synthetic. Scoring uses the unchanged production V9 engine.','','| Seed | Elapsed ms | Replay identical | Output fingerprint |','| --- | ---: | --- | --- |']
